 "notModeled": [
  "analog input (differential input -Vref to +Vref), internal 4.096-V reference and reference buffer: the result is always the 0 V code 0000h",
  "the conversion starts at the CONVST falling edge only while CS is low (p.20); the model starts it at every CONVST falling edge regardless of CS",
  "conversion abort / self-clearing reset: a CONVST falling edge with CS low, or a CS falling edge, while a conversion is in progress (within tsu(AB)) resets the converter like the RESET pin (p.21)",
  "RESET clears the output latches to zeros; the first sampling period starts 20 ns after RESET rises; minimum RESET low time 25 ns",
  "sampling start (BUSY falling with CS low, or CS falling with BUSY low), acquisition time and quiet zone around CONVST falling (50 ns before, 40 ns after); reading during a conversion returns the previous result on the part (the model always returns the 0 V code)",
  "tAcc / tDf use ten / tdis 30 ns max at +VBD = 3 V (20 ns at +VBD = 5 V); BYTE-to-data-valid td3 30 ns; BUSY delays tpd1 / tpd2",
  "byte mode: with BYTE high DB15-DB8 carry D7-D0 and DB7-DB0 are all ones (Table 2)"
 ],
